<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 21 个信源（18 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:10:24 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Mellum2.1 Instruct 发布，为编程智能体带来更快响应</title><link>https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/11/mellum2-1-instruct-is-out-bringing-faster-answers-for-coding-agents</link><description>JetBrains 推出 Mellum2.1 的轻量同门版本，面向子智能体、工具调用循环与对话场景，响应速度更快。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7dbdf429413629f189eae2b42d601ea3a4884729</guid><source url="https://blog.jetbrains.com/ai/2026/11/mellum2-1-instruct-is-out-bringing-faster-answers-for-coding-agents">JetBrains AI Blog</source></item><item><title>科学家为 AI 智能体划出界线</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/where-scientists-draw-the-line-on-ai-agents</link><description>科学家们讨论 AI 智能体在科研中可以走多远、哪些红线不能碰，为智能体的自主权划出一条参考边界。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:52:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">37b5c9ba932667510c47b67a8eaf7e479db38e02</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/where-scientists-draw-the-line-on-ai-agents">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.26.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.26.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.26.0，把 GPT-Live 演示升级到 1.1，并修了外部服务商示例的版本兼容与 Docker 资源限制问题。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:22:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0d1de3d8faa044560b468666d65806f6d0906d89</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.26.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.74.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.74.0 在核心中加入计算机操作工具契约，智能体可以直接调用 ComputerTool 完成电脑操作。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0f7a3c43cc177f44de084d995ed5d535246a68af</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.74.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>用 CUGA 打造印度语语音智能体</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/an-indic-voice-agent-with-cuga</link><description>IBM Research 用开源智能体框架 CUGA 做了一个面向印度农民的语音助手：用本地语言口头提问，它检索英文农业手册后用同种语言语音作答，关键在于用多语言嵌入模型解决跨语言检索。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:22:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d0a3a7f662b58965bac4af6309f496652b034a9c</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-research/an-indic-voice-agent-with-cuga">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>在一块 RTX PRO 6000 上爬坡优化 Inkling 2 Mini 推理</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/inkling-2-mini-inference-hillclimb</link><description>通过爬坡调优，让 Inkling 2 Mini 在单块 RTX PRO 6000 上的推理跑得更快。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d8d6777ecf09078330b26ef4bab0c3d0c914ff72</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/inkling-2-mini-inference-hillclimb">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.75.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.75.0</link><description>新版收紧了工作区文件的指令权限，RepoContext、Skills 与 Memory 中的内容不再高于 operator 权限，并新增 lowest_authority_under 配置项。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:21:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">13285c6d2bd71e1c132078ffbdb3130712c854ed</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.75.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.331</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-331</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.331 把 Code Mode 扩展到四大云平台的终端会话（Bedrock、谷歌云、Foundry 与 AWS 上的 Claude），同时应用网关新增了 OIDC 用户组配置。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:40:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d72bcce9f05f1c62d6aaa9034205be58cf3bee25</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-331">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Gemini CLI v0.71.1 发布</title><link>https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.71.1</link><description>这是一次补丁版本，将一处修复合入 v0.71.0 发布线，解决该版本的问题。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:50:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">56d5c7c32a87562e6a0670aedfac0013cca21586</guid><source url="https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.71.1">Gemini CLI Releases</source></item><item><title>GPT-6 模型展现出内在的蛋白质设计能力</title><link>https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-models-demonstrate-intrinsic-protein-design-capabilities</link><description>GPT-6 仅凭推理与代码就能设计蛋白质结构与序列，实验室测试在五个靶点上都观察到了结合迹象。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3c6728c1bfd198791155e7911f8c578086a9a218</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-models-demonstrate-intrinsic-protein-design-capabilities">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v1.107.11 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.11</link><description>Pydantic AI 1.x 分支迎来小版本更新，以常规修复为主。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:24:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">031724e287b2f316c2a726ed5cc4936da663b1ef</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.11">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.332 版本更新</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-332</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.332 支持从 MCP 服务器加载技能（测试版），并新增 PreSkillShellCommand 钩子，可在执行前拦截技能或命令的内联脚本。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:37:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">330d71ac80d9c0c0a46667c296959a0a855a7907</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-332">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Agent Lake：把智能体运行轨迹变成可复用的改进资产</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/the-agent-lake</link><description>LangSmith 推出 Agent Lake，把智能体产生的全部运行轨迹集中起来，从中筛出高价值信号，转化为修复建议与微调数据。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:32:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1413cdfc6eb60a484af064e283b759c6661db392</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/the-agent-lake">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v1.0.0-preview.2 发布</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-preview.2</link><description>Qwen Code 发布 v1.0.0-preview.2：订阅目录新增 Qwen4-Max（百万上下文，支持图片与视频输入），额度用尽时显示重置倒计时，并新增 /upgrade 命令直达订阅页。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">95160328cc4fe2ad2ae00ff0a82416b4fbf35e81</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-preview.2">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 与 Cisco 推出 Shirudo</title><link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-shirudo</link><description>OpenAI 与 Cisco 联合发布开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，帮助团队在滚动部署补丁期间依然守住正在运行的系统。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:20:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1d0c151fefed0deaf7f3ec56aad3faaff42e5184</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-shirudo">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Gemini CLI v0.72.0 预览版发布</title><link>https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.72.0-preview.0</link><description>Gemini CLI 发布 v0.72.0 预览版，修复嵌套 .gitignore 规则与 Windows 家目录路径处理，会话恢复改为回到最近活跃的会话，A2A 服务器也加上鉴权与输入校验。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:34:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">970c98f4c81a818c502eb1df9c664b31ce7189e3</guid><source url="https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.72.0-preview.0">Gemini CLI Releases</source></item><item><title>Clay 借助 Codex 与 ChatGPT 帮销售团队赢单</title><link>https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai</link><description>Clay 把 Codex 与 ChatGPT 接入销售工作流，帮用户调研客户、把数据变成可落地的获客打法，背后的推理交给 GPT-6 模型。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">99b93f3e10984935a6ab283857e5b97c678a706d</guid><source url="https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/clay-plugins-openai">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>从谱图到结构：用 Google Antigravity 的 Mass Spec Skills 鉴定分子</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/interpreting-mass-spectra-with-google-antigravity</link><description>Google Antigravity 新增 Mass Spec Skills，帮助科学家解读串联质谱数据、从谱图推断分子结构。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:07:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f14a6f6dfd19f4cad2e8dfd115373335a579422a</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/interpreting-mass-spectra-with-google-antigravity">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.72.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.72.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 发布 2.72.0，调用已被 Anthropic 或 OpenAI 下线的模型时会发出弃用警告，同时补齐 Agent 指令覆盖、实时语音指令与工具参数别名等更新。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:38:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">461d865018fda0d1bb56ffa7054375160734c62a</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.72.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.73.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.73.0</link><description>新版为调用已被 Anthropic 或 OpenAI 弃用的模型时加上弃用警告，并改进 OpenAI Responses 的输入缓存处理。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 03:53:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1465ceb18ab850ed1dc47cfda3361d31ad23cf86</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.73.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item></channel></rss>
